SPEECH MODELS
-------------

F5-TTS, via f5-tts-mlx (engine: f5-mlx)
  Model:   lucasnewman/f5-tts-mlx
  Code:    MIT (https://github.com/lucasnewman/f5-tts-mlx,
           https://github.com/SWivid/F5-TTS)
  Weights: CC-BY-NC-4.0, non-commercial use only. The pretrained F5-TTS
           weights inherit this restriction from their training data
           (the Emilia dataset). Do not use audio made with this engine in
           commercial material.

Chatterbox (engine: chatterbox)
  Model:   ResembleAI/chatterbox
  Code:    MIT (https://github.com/resemble-ai/chatterbox)
  Weights: MIT
  Note:    Audio it generates carries Resemble AI's Perth watermark
           (resemble-perth, MIT), which is applied by the upstream library.

Chatterbox MLX conversion (engine: mlx-audio)
  Model:   mlx-community/Chatterbox-TTS-fp16
  Weights: MIT, inherited from ResembleAI/chatterbox

Qwen3-TTS (engine: mlx-audio, benchmark candidate)
  Model:   mlx-community/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-0.6B-Base-bf16
           (converted from Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-0.6B-Base)
  Weights: Apache-2.0, according to Qwen's release announcement. Confirm
           against the Qwen model card before relying on it.

Other mlx-audio models
  The mlx-audio engine can load any Hugging Face repository passed with
  `--engines mlx-audio:<repo>` or the `model` setting. These have no fixed
  licence. The engine reports "unknown: review model card" unless a licence
  is configured. You are responsible for checking each one.


