BUNDLED AUDIO
-------------

bench/reference/synthetic-ref.wav was generated with the macOS `say`
command. Apple's macOS licence limits what system voice output may be used
for. The clip is a benchmark input only and is not used to narrate videos.
Replace it with a recording you own before redistributing this repository
in a commercial context. The test suite also generates audio with `say` at
run time. That audio is temporary and is not distributed.


